      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote",
        "text": "## CRT Monitor - full tube simulation\n\n**Chain:** `Pixelize -> Scanlines -> Subpixel Mask -> Bloom -> Chromatic Aberration -> Curvature -> Vignette`\n\nOrder matters - each stage feeds the next:\n\n1. **Pixel content** - slight downscale (`pixel_size 3`, `mean` pooling, light pre-blur) gives the low-res game look.\n2. **Beam and phosphor** - darkened scanline bands + RGB phosphor stripes; the mask brightens 3x because each channel only lights one third of the area.\n3. **Glow and optics** - bloom spreads the bright neon across the dark bands; radial aberration fringes the edges.\n4. **Glass and tube** - barrel curvature and vignette **last**, so the pattern curves with the glass."
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## CRT Monitor - full tube simulation\n\n**Chain:** `Pixelize -> Scanlines -> Subpixel Mask -> Bloom -> Chromatic Aberration -> Curvature -> Vignette`\n\nOrder matters - each stage feeds the next:\n\n1. **Pixel content** - slight downscale (`pixel_size 3`, `mean` pooling, light pre-blur) gives the low-res game look.\n2. **Beam and phosphor** - darkened scanline bands + RGB phosphor stripes; the mask brightens 3x because each channel only lights one third of the area.\n3. **Glow and optics** - bloom spreads the bright neon across the dark bands; radial aberration fringes the edges.\n4. **Glass and tube** - barrel curvature and vignette **last**, so the pattern curves with the glass."
      ],
